+`paginate`::
+    Accepts `true`, `false`, or `"auto"`. Automatic mode counts raw input lines and
+    opens a pager only when it exceeds 2.5 terminal pages (60 lines on a 24-row terminal).
+    Automatic mode bypasses pagination when
+    stdout is redirected, and leaves watch mode unpaginated.
+    Multiple input files count together; stdin is excluded from the automatic line count. Explicit `--paginate` and `--no-pager` override this.
+    If omitted, pagination is off for `mdcat` and on for `mdless` and `mdpick`.
+
 `margin`::
